<title>FRANCE: C. Modernes H1 net profit 223 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>C. Modernes H1 net profit 223 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>Net attributable</p>
<p>    before goodwill write-down		 223, up 13.1 percent</p>
<p>    Net after goodwill write-down	    190, up nine percent</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   390, up 20.2 percent</p>
<p>    Turnover				    14,464, 10.9 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Comptoir Modernes gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
